The Way Back is a 2010 American survival film directed by Peter
Weir, from a screenplay by Weir and Keith Clarke.

11
01:21:16,666 --> 01:21:22,666
The film is inspired by The Long Walk (1956), the memoir by former Polish prisoner of war Sławomir Rawicz, who
claimed to have escaped from a Soviet Gulag and walked 4,000 miles (6,400 km) to freedom in World War II.

12
